
Conclusion - (historical developement)

Overall, gaming has developed a lot over the years. It started mainly with simple machines and now it has become more advanced with better graphics and modern technology, such as consoles, computers and mobile phones making the gaming experience better. Nowadays, people can play games almost anywhere and play with different devices, which has made it easier for players to play with their friends without needing them to be in the same room. This shows how much gaming as changed and how it continues to improve over the time, while also giving the users more choice of gaming and giving them more better experiences that before every single time they play games. 